{"id":"626783","name":"素馅杏鲍菇水饺","author":"还在吃吃吃","authorId":"10106890","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/626783/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"300克"},{"name":"杏鲍菇","amount":"2个"},{"name":"香菇","amount":"5朵"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"半根"},{"name":"香干","amount":"1片"}],"sub":[{"name":"食用油","amount":"2勺"},{"name":"香油","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"花椒粉","amount":"半勺"},{"name":"食盐","amount":"半勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"面粉同清水混合揉成光滑的面团醒发半小时。","img":"images/626783/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"杏鲍菇洗净后对半切开，香菇去洗净后放入锅中烧水焯烫。","img":"images/626783/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"过凉水。","img":"images/626783/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"胡萝卜洗净后切丝。","img":"images/626783/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"用焯过杏鲍菇的开水下锅焯烫。","img":"images/626783/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"杏鲍菇挤干水分后放在案板上先切片切丝再切成小丁。","img":"images/626783/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"香菇切丁。","img":"images/626783/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"将胡萝卜也过凉水并挤干水分放案板上切丁。","img":"images/626783/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"将三样食材装入盆中。","img":"images/626783/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"准备1把小葱。","img":"images/626783/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"将切碎的葱花放入盆中。","img":"images/626783/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"淋上热油激发出小葱的香气。","img":"images/626783/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"倒入香油增香。","img":"images/626783/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"加入食盐。","img":"images/626783/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"加入花椒粉。","img":"images/626783/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"加入蚝油。","img":"images/626783/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/626783/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"下面剂。","img":"images/626783/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"擀皮包上馅料。","img":"images/626783/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"按照自己熟悉的手法包成饺子。","img":"images/626783/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"水烧开之后去下入饺子煮两开关火盛出饺子。","img":"images/626783/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"新鲜的水饺出锅了。","img":"images/626783/step_22.jpg"},{"step":23,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/626783/step_23.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}